{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalForms"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.sys_not_unit_lc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.sys_not_unit_lc","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L146-L156","doc":"**The repaired hypothesis is exactly what this system violates**, which is\nthe check that `normal_form_exists_of_unit_lc` is not merely a sufficient\ncondition pulled out of the air: `2` is not a unit in `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.normal_form_exists_false","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.normal_form_exists_false","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L134-L144","doc":"**The refutation.** The `normal_form_exists` axiom, instantiated at\n`G = SU2Gen`, `k = ℤ`, is false.\n\nThe axiom is universe-polymorphic and quantifies over all `G`, `k`, `ord` and\n`sys`, so refuting this instance refutes it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_no_normal_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_no_normal_form","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L126-L132","doc":"**`f` has no normal form.** It cannot step, so its only reduct is itself, and\nitself is not normal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_no_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_no_step","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L112-L124","doc":"**No step applies to `f`.** Any step would have to target `a ++ K ++ b = K`,\nforcing `a = b = []`, and then solve `c · 2 = 1` in `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_not_normal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_not_normal","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L104-L110","doc":"**`f` is not in normal form**: the rule's leading monomial `K` is an infix of\n`K`, which carries coefficient `1 ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_coeff_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_coeff_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L101-L102","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_coeff_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f_coeff_self","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L99-L99","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.f","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L96-L97","doc":"The stuck element: the monomial `K` with coefficient `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.sys_isGS","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.sys_isGS","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L91-L94","doc":"**The system is a Gröbner–Shirshov basis** — by the tree's own witness for a\nsingle-letter leading monomial. So no confluence hypothesis excludes it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rule_lc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rule_lc","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L85-L89","doc":"Its leading coefficient is `2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rule_lm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rule_lm","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L75-L83","doc":"Its leading monomial is the single letter `K`: the support is a singleton, so\nmaximality is vacuous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.sys","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.sys","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L72-L73","doc":"The one-rule system. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rule","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L69-L70","doc":"The rule `2·K ↦ …`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rel_support_nonempty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rel_support_nonempty","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L66-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rel_support","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rel_support","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L62-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.rel","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L58-L60","doc":"The relation `2·K`. Its leading coefficient is `2`, which is not a unit in\n`ℤ` — the whole point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.w","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"UGB.GrobnerShirshov.NormalFormExistsRefutation.w","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/lean/UGB/GrobnerShirshov/NormalFormExistsRefutation.lean#L55-L56","doc":"The single-letter monomial `K`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}